Author: Tariq West <tariqwest@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Aug 6 15:50:32 2026 -0400

    feat(generator): add homebrew-formula and homebrew-cask generators
    
    Adds two new generators that copy an existing formula/cask from
    homebrew/core or homebrew/cask into the user's tap by fetching the
    ruby_source_path at the API's tap_git_head, preserving the official
    token so the class name and bottle block stay aligned with the file
    name. The formula generator re-injects the current bottle block from
    the API so the copied formula stays installable.
    
    Wires the new types through the classifier (formulae.brew.sh/formula
    and /cask URLs), CLI dispatch, manifest types, build-manifest source
    records, and the package updater so update-formulas can regenerate
    them headlessly.
    
    Generated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)
    
    Co-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>

